From 3fbc6b0562ce99c5a7e54bebeb686d10e1a8debe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Gibson <mgibson041387@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:46:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Add automatic version merging for movie libraries

Emby-style behavior: a new per-library option EnableAutomaticVersionMerging
causes a post-scan task to merge movies with the same name and production
year into one item with multiple versions, even across library folders.
The merge logic moves from VideosController into a shared
IVideoVersionManager used by both the endpoint and the post-scan task.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
